### ============================================================
### AUTH — récupérer les tokens
### ============================================================

### Login Steve (owner projet Milan)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "steve@lapince.fr",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login Aurore (owner projet Paris)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "aurore@lapince.fr",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ============================================================
### GET /api/projects/:id/budgets
### ============================================================

### ✅ Budgets projet Milan — Steve (owner) → 200
### Attendu : totalSpent 594.50, totalLimit 1200, alertThreshold 80
### spentByCategory : Restaurants 84.50, Hébergement 360, Transport 150
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{steveToken}}

### ✅ Budgets projet Paris — Aurore (owner) → 200
### Attendu : totalSpent 320, totalLimit 500, alertThreshold 70
### spentByCategory : Transport 120, Hébergement 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/2/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{auroreToken}}

### ❌ Budgets projet Milan — Aurore (pas owner) → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{auroreToken}}

### ❌ Budgets projet inexistant → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/9999/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{steveToken}}

### ❌ Sans token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/budgets

### ❌ Id invalide (pas un nombre) → 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/abc/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{steveToken}}

### ============================================================
### GET /api/projects/:id/balance
### ============================================================

### ✅ Balance projet Milan — Steve (owner) → 200
### Attendu :
### Steve  : totalPaid 234.50, totalOwed 198.17, balance +36.33
### Aurore : totalPaid 360,    totalOwed 198.17, balance +161.83
### Ludo   : totalPaid 0,      totalOwed 198.16, balance -198.16
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{steveToken}}

### ✅ Balance projet Paris — Aurore (owner) → 200
### Attendu :
### Aurore : totalPaid 320, totalOwed 160, balance +160
### Ludo   : totalPaid 0,   totalOwed 160, balance -160
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/2/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{auroreToken}}

### ❌ Balance projet Milan — Aurore (pas owner) → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{auroreToken}}

### ❌ Balance projet inexistant → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/9999/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{steveToken}}

### ❌ Sans token → 401
